hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1630","###\n Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim ad-Dawraqi, Yusuf ibn Musa, and a group said: \Jarir ibn Abd al-Hamid narrated to us"," from Umarah ibn al-Qa'qa'"," from Abu Zur'ah"," from Abu Hurairah (RA)"," who said: 'When the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said the Takbir in the prayer"," he would remain silent for a brief moment. I said"," \""O Messenger of Allah (ﷺ)"," may my father and mother be sacrificed for"""
"1631","Narrated to us Abu Bakr: The narration of Ali ibn Abi Talib regarding the Prophet (ﷺ) initiating the prayer from this chapter. This is a lengthy chapter, and I have already included it in the *Kitab al-Kabir*.\n\n**CHAPTER:**"
